estructible sandboxes packed with familiar scenery. Every contract is a chaotic playground where anything can collapse or hilariously backfire.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TOOLS OF MASS DISTRACTION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4498480/extras/6e9c191ea58d9403ffd5fa746108ebfa.poster.avif?t=1788189818\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4498480/extras/6e9c191ea58d9403ffd5fa746108ebfa.webm?t=1788189818\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4498480/extras/6e9c191ea58d9403ffd5fa746108ebfa.mp4?t=1788189818\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your gear is perfect for the job... and even better for trolling your crew. Sledgehammer walls and your buddies, of course! Finish the contract, or just spend the shift pranking each other. Works either way!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HOME SWEET HOME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4498480/extras/48dc38bbd36c86f6260c08a7d5d40ba6.poster.avif?t=1788189818\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4498480/extras/48dc38bbd36c86f6260c08a7d5d40ba6.webm?t=1788189818\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4498480/extras/48dc38bbd36c86f6260c08a7d5d40ba6.mp4?t=1788189818\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a shift, kick back at your base to play mini-games and customize your place. Toss your hard-earn